        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> Prolog.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hloþhære ⁊ Eadric, Cantwara cyningas, ecton þa ǽ þa ðe heora aldoras ær geworhton ðyssum domum, þe hyr efter sægeþ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Hloþhere and Eadric, kings of the people of Kent, added to the laws that their ancestors made before with these decrees, which are stated hereafter.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hloþhære ⁊ Eadric Cantwara cyningas, ecton þa ǽ, þa ðe heora aldoras ær geworhton, ðyssum domum þe hyr efter sægeþ.</ab>
